# What the image never gets. The image carries only src, the built web/dist, migrations,
# alembic.ini and the two docs files the code reads at run time (see the Dockerfile COPY lines).
# Patterns match from the context root; `*` never crosses a "/", so key rules use `**/`.

# Key material and secrets, at any depth (CLAUDE.md hard rule).
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.json
**/*-write.json
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
!package.json

# Not for the server image (the human, 21 Oct, tidy stop before R5 T16).
.git
.github
.venv
.claude
.scratch
data
docs
docs/test-reports
!docs/DECISIONS.md
!docs/goal-deliverable-map.yaml
scripts
tests
web/tests
**/__pycache__
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.coverage

# Dashboard v2 (D145): the web stage installs and builds; never copy a laptop build in.
web/node_modules
src/saley/web/dist
